{
  "id": "activity-failure-texts-localized",
  "kind": "recommended",
  "summary": "Visible change for German chats: the failure details the SDK writes itself (tool not permitted, turn limits, endpoint errors, memory tools) show in German. New optional ChatLocale keys activityFailure… and ActivityStep.failures.",
  "howTo": "Check tests or CSS that assert the English failure texts in a German chat. An app whose own locale words the activity log keeps English failure texts unless it states language, sets the activityFailure… keys or spreads deChatLocale. A custom activity log can render ActivityStep.failures with stepFailureText(failures, locale, language).",
  "skill": "building-glirastes-chat-ui#message-layout",
  "affectedWhen": {
    "imports": [
      "glirastes/react",
      "glirastes/embed"
    ]
  },
  "adoptedWhen": {
    "patterns": [
      "\\bactivityFailure[A-Z]\\w*\\s*:",
      "\\bstepFailureText\\b"
    ]
  },
  "surface": [
    "glirastes/react#ActivityStep.failures",
    "glirastes/react#StepFailure.*",
    "glirastes/react#StepFailureCode",
    "glirastes/react#stepFailureText",
